    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The humans are gone.</strong> The world has fallen to the undead, and only the <strong>animals</strong> remain. In a world overrun by zombies, nature\u2019s fiercest survivors must rise up and fight back! In <strong>PAW</strong>, you and up to <strong>three friends</strong> take control of powerful animals, scavenge for upgrades, and battle against relentless zombie hordes in a fight for survival.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3616450/extras/cc49ffe5c881b6f7b95371020e164537.poster.avif?t=1755602431\" width=622 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3616450/extras/cc49ffe5c881b6f7b95371020e164537.webm?t=1755602431\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3616450/extras/cc49ffe5c881b6f7b95371020e164537.mp4?t=1755602431\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Survive, Defend, Evolve!</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Choose Your Animal</strong>: Play as different animals, each with unique abilities and playstyles.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Scavenge &amp; Upgrade</strong> \u2013 Collect loot and <strong>Essence</strong> from fallen zombies to power up your skills and abilities.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Roll up the slot machines and see what you can get.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >How long can you last against an endless zombie onslaught? Protect vital strongholds from being overrun!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Permanent Progression</strong>:\u00a0Leftover <strong>Essence</strong> can be spent in the <strong>Library</strong>, unlocking permanent upgrades that make each new run stronger than the last.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Multiplayer</strong>: Local Shared Screen Co-Op for up to 4 players</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The fate of the world rests on paws, claws, and fangs. Fast, chaotic, and endlessly replayable, <strong>PAW</strong> is the ultimate test of survival instincts. <strong>Are you ready to take back the world?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3616450/extras/387d56612a96b525bd33ddb8508b225e.webp?t=1755602431\" width=600 height=38 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
