/p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Multiplayer</strong>: Local Shared Screen Co-Op for up to 4 players</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The fate of the world rests on paws, claws, and fangs. Fast, chaotic, and endlessly replayable, <strong>PAW</strong> is the ultimate test of survival instincts. <strong>Are you ready to take back the world?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3616450/extras/387d56612a96b525bd33ddb8508b225e.webp?t=1755602431\" width=600 height=38 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
